From 1abf1c0e94b9c2d8211561f40bff90235ec908d0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jaka Hudoklin <jaka@x-truder.net>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 13:36:18 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(vault): browser_vault masked prompt cards

Unlock/save-login/2FA prompts from the browser vault now surface as masked
cards in the WebUI chat instead of refusing with unlock_unavailable.
Mirrors the clarify card flow: api/vault_prompts.py pending queue,
/api/vault/pending + /api/vault/respond routes, per-turn unlock callbacks
in streaming.py (tool threads inherit them), card markup/signals in
messages.js plus i18n defaults. Credential answers travel only through the
respond POST into the waiting entry; never journalled, logged or echoed.
